# =============================================================================
# Trivy Ignore List — Accepted Risks
# =============================================================================
# These CVEs are present in the Python base image's tooling and are NOT
# reachable from the LearningSteps API's application code paths.
# Each entry documents the rationale for accepting the risk.
#
# Reviewed: 2026-10-01
# Review by: 2027-01-01
# =============================================================================

# msgpack - MessagePack for Python
# The LearningSteps API does not use MessagePack serialization anywhere.
# msgpack is a transitive dependency of the base image's pip tooling only.
# CVE: Out-of-bounds read on Unpacker reuse.
GHSA-6v7p-g79w-8964

# setuptools - Path Traversal in PackageIndex
# The LearningSteps API does not use setuptools at runtime.
# setuptools is present for pip's build tooling only.
# CVE: Path traversal when installing packages from untrusted indexes.
CVE-2025-47273

# urllib3 - Proxy TLS + Chunk parser DoS
# The LearningSteps API is a server; it does not make outbound HTTPS
# requests through proxies. urllib3 is a transitive dependency.
# CVE: TLS interception via proxy configuration override.
# CVE: DoS via unbounded memory in chunk parser.
CVE-2026-97687
CVE-2026-97689
